<title>UK: Norman becomes new chairman of ASDA.</title>
<headline>Norman becomes new chairman of ASDA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archie Norman took charge as chairman of UK supermarket chain ASDA Group Plc on Friday, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Norman replaces Patrick Gillam who retired as chairman and a director of the company on Friday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
